# 詞: 銀包

1. 佢好愛買名牌，每次出街都係帶埋銀包。 (He loves buying branded items and always carries a wallet when going out.)
2. 我銀包內面有好多張卡，但我唔知點樣整理。 (There are many cards in my wallet, but I don't know how to organize them.)
3. 佢銀包掛喺手袋，出街前唔好忘記拿。 (He hangs his wallet on his handbag; don't forget to take it before going out.)
4. 我銀包好細，唔好意思請人食飯。 (My wallet is too thin; I feel embarrassed to treat others to a meal.)
5. 佢銀包係真皮嘅，用咗好耐用。 (His wallet is made of genuine leather and is very durable.)
6. 我銀包內面有現金，但我慣用電子錢。 (There is cash in my wallet, but I'm used to using electronic money.)
7. 佢銀包好大，可以放好多東西。 (His wallet is large and can hold many things.)
8. 我銀包係禮物，佢好用心選。 (This wallet is a gift; he chose it very thoughtfully.)
9. 佢銀包係黑色嘅，好襯身。 (His wallet is black and looks very stylish.)
10. 我銀包內面有身份證，出街前要記得放返。 (There is an ID card in my wallet; remember to put it back before going out.) [end of text]


